00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:03.910
Gimme a break!

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:04.510
Why, you...
Gimme a break!

00:15:04.510 --> 00:15:05.280
I'm not pulling that hard!
Why, you...

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:07.710
I'm not pulling that hard!

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.930
No one's coming... The customers, I mean.

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:13.990
That's all right, sometimes.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:28.010
The Grand Prize goes to this model!
Yeah, right!

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:29.810
That's cute!

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:32.140
Madoka's picture looks wonderful too!

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:36.290
Hmm... I sure would like to see him
take more portraits!

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.590
Like, nudie pics, or... Huh...?

00:15:38.590 --> 00:15:40.990
Don't say such perverted things, Komatsu!

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:43.430
Er, sorry... Wait a sec! YOU said that!

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:45.430
Say, Darling...

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:48.460
Which do you prefer...
the photo, or the real thing?

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:55.940
My, thank you all for helping!
Thank you very much for your hard work!

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:58.140
I bet you're all hungry.
Let me treat you to a meal!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.810
Yeah!

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:03.570
Well, after working SO HARD, anyone would be hungry, right? Uh-huh!

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:18.330
Oh? What's wrong?
I'll be with you soon, so...

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:21.220
Um... there's something
I'd like to talk to you about...

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:24.220
W... What is it?

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:33.810
W... What's wrong?

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.940
You've been... acting weird today.

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:37.000
What do you mean?
You've been... acting weird today.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:37.970
Weird!
What do you mean?

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:38.010
Weird!

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:40.010
Weird! Weird!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.240
Weird! Weird!

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:44.360
No matter what I say to you,
you're not paying attention to me!

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:47.260
Th... That's not true!

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:50.520
It is so! You've got someone new,
isn't that right?

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:51.860
What?!

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:53.180
You have someone new, huh?!
What?!

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:54.830
There's nobody like that!
You have someone new, huh?!

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:54.960
There's nobody like that!

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:55.750
You're lying!
There's nobody like that!

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:57.120
No, I'm not!
You're lying!

00:16:57.460 --> 00:17:00.200
You can tell me the truth, you know that!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.900
I... I AM telling you the truth...

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:05.930
Will you swear it to "Hell's Judge?"
I... I AM telling you the truth...

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:06.000
Huh? N... Well... I will.
Will you swear it to "Hell's Judge?"

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.100
Huh? N... Well... I will.

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:14.180
Yes, I can swear!

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:17.140
I'm glad... It's just like what Madoka said!

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:19.820
Huh? Ayukawa said that?!

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:25.410
Uh-huh. I talked to Madoka 'cause you started giving me the cold shoulder.

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:28.890
When I did, Madoka said...

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:30.330
Huh?!
When I did, Madoka said...

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:33.430
Huh?!

00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:37.390
"Things will be all right if I
stay close to you all the time!"

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:42.300
Does it look like we
hosted a party in here now?

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:44.410
You don't have to go this far...

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.920
Now that we've told a lie,
we've got to "complete it," you know!

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:49.920
What if the guys stop over?!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:52.480
Master...

00:17:57.850 --> 00:18:00.060
Gosh! "Delicious!"

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:02.120
The ultimate in gourmet food!

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:06.740
There's nothing like a meal after working hard!

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:08.760
...yeah, right.

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:14.350
Oh! Yours look so good!

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:16.540
You dumb-ass! It's gonna taste the same!

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:18.010
Huh?!

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:19.210
What in the world is that?!

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:21.180
Where?!
What in the world is that?!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:26.050
Did you just do something?

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:29.790
Komatsu! I think your serving is smaller, don't you agree?

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.480
Huh? Oh! You're right!

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:38.540
Ayukawa... Ayukawa...

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:40.260
You ate my potato salad, didn't you!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:40.690
He who makes the first move wins!
You ate my potato salad, didn't you!

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:42.600
Gimme that!
He who makes the first move wins!

00:18:45.570 --> 00:18:48.540
...she did it for Hikaru...

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:57.050
Oh? Where are you going, Sempai?

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:58.280
M... Men's room...

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.980
This way, please... Huh?!
M... Men's room...

00:19:05.090 --> 00:19:07.600
Hello, this is the Ayukawa residence.

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:09.730
We are out at the moment.

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:16.290
Kindly leave your name and a brief message
after you hear the beep.

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:20.640
Er... It's me, Kasuga...

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:23.380
Er... this is the second time I'm calling...

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:27.210
...a... and... er... I... er...

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:33.130
Master, where's Ayukawa?!

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:38.080
Good night!

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:55.320
...so... the reason why I called was because...

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:59.140
I'm sorry to keep calling you! It's me, Kasuga... Er...

00:22:05.070 --> 00:22:08.180
Hello, this is the Ayukawa residence.

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:10.380
We are out at the moment.

00:22:10.380 --> 00:22:17.750
Kindly leave your name and a brief message
after you hear the beep.

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:20.160
Beep!

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:22.710
This is your fifth call!

00:22:23.920 --> 00:22:27.080
Gosh... It's all right...

00:22:28.090 --> 00:22:30.200
A... Ayukawa...

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:32.060
I know...

00:22:41.100 --> 00:22:42.240
"Kasuga Takashi's 7th Solo Exhibition:
Midst of a Journey - I was young then."

00:22:42.240 --> 00:22:44.230
O...Oh!

00:22:50.710 --> 00:22:54.630
Just like you said, Manami... Madoka looks great!

00:22:54.630 --> 00:22:56.760
Hikaru looks pretty too!

00:22:56.760 --> 00:22:57.960
Yeah! Yeah!

00:22:57.960 --> 00:23:01.930
Both are... the BEST!

00:23:01.930 --> 00:23:03.760
Say, what do YOU think, Oniichan?

00:23:03.760 --> 00:23:04.450
Er...

00:23:04.450 --> 00:23:04.530
Say, what do YOU think, Oniichan?

00:23:04.530 --> 00:23:06.060
Which do you think is better?

00:23:06.060 --> 00:23:08.550
Er... W... Well, that's, er...

00:23:08.550 --> 00:23:08.630
Which do you think is better?

00:23:08.630 --> 00:23:11.170
How can I possibly decide?!

00:23:11.170 --> 00:23:13.290
Give a clear answer!

00:23:13.640 --> 00:23:16.180
I don't need Kurumi and Manami to tell me I need to do that.

00:23:16.180 --> 00:23:19.750
Which of the two...
Hikaru or Ayukawa... is better?!

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:21.220
Which is better?!

00:23:21.220 --> 00:23:24.250
To be honest, I can't possibly give an answer...

00:23:26.820 --> 00:23:29.790
Oh! Darling!

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:33.930
I can't...

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:35.560
I... I mean...

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:38.590
I cannot...

00:23:39.760 --> 00:23:42.730
I cannot...

00:23:54.910 --> 00:24:02.530
I dream of casting a spell that captures your heart...

00:24:02.530 --> 00:24:10.100
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:25.450
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory. I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.450 --> 00:24:38.060
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.060 --> 00:24:48.270
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.270 --> 00:24:55.280
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.280 --> 00:25:06.680
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:12.760 --> 00:25:14.630
"We are not alone."

00:25:14.630 --> 00:25:17.330
"We are not the only ones in the universe..."

00:25:17.330 --> 00:25:18.640
...yeah, right.

00:25:18.640 --> 00:25:21.670
We know better, but if you ever
get to see it with your own eyes...

00:25:21.670 --> 00:25:24.210
...it's really incredible!

00:25:24.210 --> 00:25:27.140
But, what really happened was...

00:25:27.140 --> 00:25:31.570
Next time: "Well, do you believe it or not?
Madoka saw a UFO."
